      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Piece of Equipment used for making one or more Samples accessible for a Measurement or for holding them in place in the predefined position to be mounted inside the Instrument. Examples of Sample Holder are: a glass slide, a TEM grid, or a tilting support. Depending on the scientific use case, a Sample Holder may carry or be carried by a Sample Carrier."
      }
